{"n":91,"v":[["Par le soleil et par sa clarté","",[[["وَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["شَّمْسِ","N","F|GEN",330]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ضُحَىٰ","N","M|GEN",1192],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["Et par la lune quand elle le suit","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["قَمَرِ","N","M|GEN",391]],[["إِذَا","N","T",23]],[["تَلَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",185],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["Et par le jour quand il l'éclaire","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["نَّهَارِ","N","M|GEN",197]],[["إِذَا","N","T",23]],[["جَلَّىٰ","V","PERF|VF:2|3MS",2336],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["Et par la nuit quand elle l'enveloppe","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلَّ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["يْلِ","N","M|GEN",123]],[["إِذَا","N","T",23]],[["يَغْشَىٰ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3MS|MOOD:IND",671],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["Et par le ciel et Celui qui l'a construit","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["سَّمَآءِ","N","F|GEN",34]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["بَنَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",784],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["Et par la terre et Celui qui l'a étendue","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["أَرْضِ","N","F|GEN",21]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["طَحَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",4702],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["Et par l'âme et Celui qui l'a harmonieusement façonnée","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["نَفْسٍ","N","FS|INDEF|GEN",36]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["سَوَّىٰ","V","PERF|VF:2|3MS",657],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]]]],["et lui a alors inspiré son immoralité, de même que sa piété","",[[["فَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["أَلْهَمَ","V","PERF|VF:4|3MS",4703],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]],[["فُجُورَ","N","M|ACC",4704],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["تَقْوَى